Probes shows who is probing your network from the internet: the packets
blocked coming in on your WAN, from the firewall log. Reporting, Probes has a
graph (all blocked packets, and those blocked by blocklists such as Spamhaus
DROP), searchable lists of sources and ports, each source's detail, and a
world map by country (from the GeoIP database OPNsense downloads for GeoIP
aliases). A dashboard widget shows the last 24 hours. 30 days are kept.

